{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_040F10","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"说起来，还有“瞄准点。你要杀的只是一个男人”这句话……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯。那也是格瓦拉说过的话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"据说格瓦拉在玻利维亚被捕后，就在被杀前，对准备向他开枪的士兵说了这句话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"El Che果然厉害。自己马上就要被杀了，还能说出这种话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"古巴革命后，格瓦拉放弃了新政府里的职位，转而帮助其他国家的革命。他大概早就做好了随时赴死的准备。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"我呢，只是被拷问了一下就……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"Chico，你不是已经重生成<R=新人,HOMBRE NUEVO>了吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=新人,HOMBRE NUEVO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"嗯……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""}]}